// Procedural surface tiles (rmc_client::surfaces). Edited in the game:
// F1, then F11. `enabled: false` keeps the image tiles of tiles.ron.
//
// Per material key, a recipe for `all` faces or for `top` / `side` /
// `bottom` (bottom falls back to all, then side). A recipe runs seamless
// value noise through `colors` (low to high, sRGB): `cells` sets the blob
// size, `octaves` and `persistence` the detail and roughness, `contrast`
// spreads the value, `speckle` mixes in per-texel noise, `stretch` > 1
// lays it in horizontal bands, `steps` gives hard color bands, and a
// `fringe` paints its own colors along the top edge (grass over dirt).
